id: integrated-weapon
name: Integrated Weapon
order: 4
category: body
# A Factor Trait replaces a Secondary Racial Trait - Secondary, then, unless it names a Primary one to replace.
importance: secondary
# (1) "create a Weapon" - of the Weapon Category chosen.
choose: weaponCategory
grantsWeapon: chosen
grantsWeaponGrade: 4
grantsWeaponQualities: regenerating
description: >
  A powerful weapon has been included in your cybernetic augmentations.
text: >
  Integrated Weapon (Body): A powerful weapon has been included in your cybernetic augmentations.
  (1)-[Passive]: When you gain this Factor Trait, create a Weapon of Craftsmanship Grade 4 and Integrate it. This Weapon additionally has the Regenerating Quality. This Quality does not occupy any Quality Slots.
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase the Wound Rolls of any Attacking Maneuvers made with an Integrated Weapon by 2(T).

---

# (1) Its headers: the Weapon Category chosen as it is gained, its Weapon made on the Gear tab - Grade 4, Integrated, Active where
# there is room, the Regenerating Quality in no Slot - and gone with it (racial.mjs grantWeapon). Its other Qualities the player's.
[passive]
# (2) Any Integrated Weapon's (chat.mjs integratedWeaponWound).
allow integratedWeapon.wound;
